<div class="not-prose">
<p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">Most tows inside Spokane cost <strong class="text-white">$200</strong>. Online estimates use a <strong class="text-white">$140 hook fee plus $6 per mile, with a $200 minimum</strong>, so any tow under about 10 miles lands at the minimum. Longer tows add $6 for each mile. You hear the exact price on the phone before a truck is sent, and you can say no.</p><p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">Spokane Towing is a dispatch line: when you call (509) 797-7999, we connect you with a local partner tow company that does the tow. This page explains how the price is worked out, what can change it, and how to keep the bill down.</p><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-14 mb-5 pt-10 border-t border-slate-800">How the price is calculated</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6"><div class="border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-5"><p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2" aria-hidden="true">$140</p><p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white">Hook fee ($140):</strong> covers sending the truck, hooking or loading your vehicle, and securing it.</p></div><div class="border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-5"><p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2" aria-hidden="true">$6/mi</p><p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white">Mileage ($6 per mile):</strong> counted from where your vehicle is picked up to where it is dropped off.</p></div><div class="border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-5"><p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2" aria-hidden="true">$200</p><p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white">$200 minimum:</strong> short tows are never billed below $200, even if hook fee plus mileage comes out lower.</p></div></div><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-14 mb-5 pt-10 border-t border-slate-800">Spokane towing cost examples</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto my-6 rounded-xl border bo